Prepared UPF pseudopotential data

This directory currently contains one supplemented H USPP example for use
through the normal CP2K data lookup, including offline regressions. It is
derived from SSSP v2.0, not a complete or unchanged SSSP release. Calculation
support depends on the CP2K build and supported method. The original SSSP
collections remain separate, optional upstream inputs.

H.us.pbe.z_1.ld1.psl.v1.0.0-high-full-waves.upf

Scalar H USPP with one valence electron, PBE and PSLibrary 1.0.0 high settings.
The original SSSP v2.0 PBE Precision H potential is supplemented with original
per-projector all-electron and pseudo partial waves from a compatible replay.
The original potential, projectors, overlap augmentation, radial mesh and
quadrature data match that replay. The original numerical arrays are retained.
Only PP_FULL_WFC and its header flag are added by
tools/pseudopotentials/add_upf_full_waves.py. The embedded generator input and
original author information remain in PP_INFO.

