Download the original collections into a separately chosen writable cache,
not into this directory. For download and preparation instructions see
tools/pseudopotentials/README.md. Downloading original USPPs does not recover
missing full partial waves; an independently verified generator replay is
required. No files are downloaded when CP2K starts a calculation.

The original cutoff files give upstream plane-wave recommendations, not
Gaussian basis or Quickstep multigrid settings. Neither a successful import
nor the small H2 regression establishes production convergence.

